==================================================
1. OVERALL GOAL
==================================================

Create a polished, professional, fully 2D sprite-based fighting game that runs in a web browser and is suitable for GitHub Pages hosting.

The game must work well on:

- Desktop/laptop computers in landscape layouts
- Phones in landscape orientation
- Tablets in landscape orientation

This is a pure 2D game.

DO NOT use:
- Three.js
- Babylon.js
- WebGL 3D engines
- 3D models
- 3D environments
- 3D assets
- 3D libraries
- fake 3D character models

Use standard HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and the HTML5 Canvas 2D API.

Prefer a dependency-free implementation.

The repository MUST contain a working index.html because the game will be deployed with GitHub Pages.

All asset references must use relative URLs such as:
./assets/...
./0001_idle1.png

Do NOT use root-relative paths such as:
"/assets/..."

GitHub project pages may run under /maxy/, so root-relative URLs may break deployment.

The visual identity of Maxy should feel modern, stylish, clean, responsive, and professional rather than like a basic HTML demo.

